  "notes": [
    "**Visitar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Used for visiting people or places",
    "Common usage: *visitar a un amigo* (to visit a friend), *visitar un museo* (to visit a museum)",
    "Use personal \"a\" when visiting people: *Visité a mi abuela* (I visited my grandmother)",
    "Related noun: **la visita** (the visit / the visitor)"
